  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The mountain is full of bumps and craters made by falling raindrops. When it rains, raindrops as large as wine vats fall and form huge craters, so Tong clan village is built in empty caves inside the mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        245
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Twenty days after Hun Mu Mountain, the caravan arrives at Ju Yu mountain. In Tong clan village, the golden lamp oil Fang Yuan bought on Huang Jin Mountain is very popular. During the stay it rains three times, and Fang Yuan acquires many blue oil raindrops, a material for many different purposes. Those giant raindrops are also Tong clan village’s source of income. After leaving Ju Yu mountain, the caravan arrives at Fang Zhuan Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        245
      ],
